{"page":103,"verses":[{"verse_key":"4:155","surah":4,"ayah":155,"ar_uthmani":"فَبِمَا نَقْضِهِم مِّيثَـٰقَهُمْ وَكُفْرِهِم بِـَٔايَـٰتِ ٱللَّهِ وَقَتْلِهِمُ ٱلْأَنۢبِيَآءَ بِغَيْرِ حَقٍّ وَقَوْلِهِمْ قُلُوبُنَا غُلْفٌۢ ۚ بَلْ طَبَعَ ٱللَّهُ عَلَيْهَا بِكُفْرِهِمْ فَلَا يُؤْمِنُونَ إِلَّا قَلِيلًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"And so for breaking their pledge, for rejecting God’s revelations, for unjustly killing their prophets, for saying ‘Our minds are closed’- No! God has sealed them in their disbelief, so they believe only a little-","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَبِمَا","en_gloss":"Then because of","transliteration":"fabimā","verse_key":"4:155"},{"pos":2,"ar":"نَقْضِهِم","en_gloss":"their breaking","transliteration":"naqḍihim","verse_key":"4:155"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مِّيثَـٰقَهُمْ","en_gloss":"(of) their covenant","transliteration":"mīthāqahum","verse_key":"4:155"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَكُفْرِهِم","en_gloss":"and their disbelief","transliteration":"wakuf'rihim","verse_key":"4:155"},{"pos":5,"ar":"بِـَٔايَـٰتِ","en_gloss":"in (the) Signs","transliteration":"biāyāti","verse_key":"4:155"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"(of) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"4:155"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَقَتْلِهِمُ","en_gloss":"and their killing","transliteration":"waqatlihimu","verse_key":"4:155"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلْأَنۢبِيَآءَ","en_gloss":"(of) the Prophets","transliteration":"l-anbiyāa","verse_key":"4:155"},{"pos":9,"ar":"بِغَيْرِ","en_gloss":"without","transliteration":"bighayri","verse_key":"4:155"},{"pos":10,"ar":"حَقٍّۢ","en_gloss":"any right","transliteration":"ḥaqqin","verse_key":"4:155"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَقَوْلِهِمْ","en_gloss":"and their saying","transliteration":"waqawlihim","verse_key":"4:155"},{"pos":12,"ar":"قُلُوبُنَا","en_gloss":"Our hearts","transliteration":"qulūbunā","verse_key":"4:155"},{"pos":13,"ar":"غُلْفٌۢ ۚ","en_gloss":"(are) wrapped","transliteration":"ghul'fun","verse_key":"4:155"},{"pos":14,"ar":"بَلْ","en_gloss":"Nay","transliteration":"bal","verse_key"