شُبِّهَ لَهُمْ ۚ وَإِنَّ ٱلَّذِينَ ٱخْتَلَفُوا۟ فِيهِ لَفِى شَكٍّ مِّنْهُ ۚ مَا لَهُم بِهِۦ مِنْ عِلْمٍ إِلَّا ٱتِّبَاعَ ٱلظَّنِّ ۚ وَمَا قَتَلُوهُ يَقِينًۢا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"and said, ‘We have killed the Messiah, Jesus, son of Mary, the Messenger of God.’ (They did not kill him, nor did they crucify him, though it was made to appear like that to them; those that disagreed about him are full of doubt, with no knowledge to follow, only supposition: they certainly did not kill him-","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَقَوْلِهِمْ","en_gloss":"And for their saying","transliteration":"waqawlihim","verse_key":"4:157"},{"pos":2,"ar":"إِنَّا","en_gloss":"Indeed, we","transliteration":"innā","verse_key":"4:157"},{"pos":3,"ar":"قَتَلْنَا","en_gloss":"killed","transliteration":"qatalnā","verse_key":"4:157"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلْمَسِيحَ","en_gloss":"the Messiah","transliteration":"l-masīḥa","verse_key":"4:157"},{"pos":5,"ar":"عِيسَى","en_gloss":"Isa","transliteration":"ʿīsā","verse_key":"4:157"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱبْنَ","en_gloss":"son","transliteration":"ib'na","verse_key":"4:157"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مَرْيَمَ","en_gloss":"(of) Maryam","transliteration":"maryama","verse_key":"4:157"},{"pos":8,"ar":"رَسُولَ","en_gloss":"(the) Messenger","transliteration":"rasūla","verse_key":"4:157"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"(of) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"4:157"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"And not","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"4:157"},{"pos":11,"ar":"قَتَلُوهُ","en_gloss":"they killed him","transliteration":"qatalūhu","verse_key":"4:157"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"4:157"},{"pos":13,"ar":"صَلَبُوهُ","en_gloss":"they crucified him","transliteration":"ṣalabūhu","verse_key":"4:157"},{"pos":14,"ar":"وَلَـٰكِن","en_gloss":"but","transliteration":"walākin","verse_key":"4:157"},{"pos":15,"ar":"شُبِّهَ","en_gloss":"it was made to appear (so)","transliteration":"shubbiha","verse_key":"4:157"},{"pos":16,"ar":"