حَكِيمًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"God raised him up to Himself. God is almighty and wise.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"بَل","en_gloss":"Nay","transliteration":"bal","verse_key":"4:158"},{"pos":2,"ar":"رَّفَعَهُ","en_gloss":"he was raised","transliteration":"rafaʿahu","verse_key":"4:158"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"(by) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"4:158"},{"pos":4,"ar":"إِلَيْهِ ۚ","en_gloss":"towards Him","transliteration":"ilayhi","verse_key":"4:158"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَكَانَ","en_gloss":"And is","transliteration":"wakāna","verse_key":"4:158"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"4:158"},{"pos":7,"ar":"عَزِيزًا","en_gloss":"All-Mighty","transliteration":"ʿazīzan","verse_key":"4:158"},{"pos":8,"ar":"حَكِيمًۭا","en_gloss":"All-Wise","transliteration":"ḥakīman","verse_key":"4:158"},{"pos":9,"ar":"١٥٨","en_gloss":"(158)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"4:158"}]},{"verse_key":"4:159","surah":4,"ayah":159,"ar_uthmani":"وَإِن مِّنْ أَهْلِ ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ إِلَّا لَيُؤْمِنَنَّ بِهِۦ قَبْلَ مَوْتِهِۦ ۖ وَيَوْمَ ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ يَكُونُ عَلَيْهِمْ شَهِيدًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"There is not one of the People of the Book who will not believe in [Jesus] before his death, and on the Day of Resurrection he will be a witness against them.)","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَإِن","en_gloss":"And (there is) not","transliteration":"wa-in","verse_key":"4:159"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مِّنْ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"4:159"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَهْلِ","en_gloss":"(the) People","transliteration":"ahli","verse_key":"4:159"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ","en_gloss":"(of) the Book","transliteration":"l-kitābi","verse_key":"4:159"},{"pos":5,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"but","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"4:159"},{"pos":6,"ar":"لَيُؤْمِنَنَّ","en_gloss":"surely he believes","transliteration":"layu'minanna","verse_key":"4:159"},{"pos":7,"ar":"بِهِۦ","en_gloss":"in him","transliteration":"bihi","verse_key":"4:159"},{"pos":8,"ar":"قَبْلَ","en_gloss":"before","transliteration":"qabla","verse_key":"4:159"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مَوْتِهِۦ ۖ","en_gloss":"his death","transliteration":"mawtihi","verse_key":"4:159"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَيَوْمَ","en_gloss":"And (on the) Day","transliteration":"wayawma","verse_key":"4:159"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ","en_gloss":"(of) the Resurrection","transliteration":"l-qiyāmati","verse_key":"4:159"},{"pos":12,"ar":"يَكُونُ","en_gloss":"he will be","transliteration":"yakūnu","verse_key":"4:159"},{"pos":13,"ar":"عَلَيْهِمْ","en_gloss":"against them","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","verse_key":"4:159"},{"pos":14,"ar":"شَهِيدًۭا","en_gloss":"a witness","transliteration":"shahīdan","verse_key":"4:159"},{"pos":15,"ar":"١٥٩","en_gloss":"(159)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"4:159"}]},{"verse_key":"4:160","surah":4,"ayah":160,"ar_uthmani":"فَبِظُلْمٍ مِّنَ ٱلَّذِينَ هَادُوا۟ حَرَّمْنَا عَلَيْهِمْ طَيِّبَـٰتٍ أُحِلَّتْ لَهُمْ وَبِصَدِّهِمْ عَن سَبِيلِ ٱللَّهِ كَثِيرًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"For the wrongdoings done by the Jews, We forbade them certain good things that had been permitted to them before: for having frequently debarred others from God’s path;","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَبِظُلْمٍۢ","en_gloss":"Then for (the) wrongdoing","transliteration":"fabiẓul'min","verse_key":"4:160"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مِّنَ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"4:160"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"4:160"},{"pos":4,"ar":"هَادُوا۟","en_gloss":"were Jews","transliteration":"hādū","verse_key":"4:160"},{"pos":5,"ar":"حَرَّمْنَا","en_gloss":"We made unlawful","transliteration":"ḥarramnā","verse_key":"4:160"},{"pos":6,"ar":"عَلَيْهِمْ","en_gloss":"for them","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","verse_key":"4:160"},{"pos":7,"ar":"طَيِّبَـٰتٍ","en_gloss":"good things","transliteration":"ṭayyibātin","verse_key":"4:160"},{"pos":8,"ar":"أُحِلَّتْ","en_gloss":"which had been lawful","transliteration":"uḥillat","v