s":"wrongfully","transliteration":"bil-bāṭili","verse_key":"4:161"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَأَعْتَدْنَا","en_gloss":"And We have prepared","transliteration":"wa-aʿtadnā","verse_key":"4:161"},{"pos":11,"ar":"لِلْكَـٰفِرِينَ","en_gloss":"for the disbelievers","transliteration":"lil'kāfirīna","verse_key":"4:161"},{"pos":12,"ar":"مِنْهُمْ","en_gloss":"among them","transliteration":"min'hum","verse_key":"4:161"},{"pos":13,"ar":"عَذَابًا","en_gloss":"a punishment","transliteration":"ʿadhāban","verse_key":"4:161"},{"pos":14,"ar":"أَلِيمًۭا","en_gloss":"painful","transliteration":"alīman","verse_key":"4:161"},{"pos":15,"ar":"١٦١","en_gloss":"(161)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"4:161"}]},{"verse_key":"4:162","surah":4,"ayah":162,"ar_uthmani":"لَّـٰكِنِ ٱلرَّٰسِخُونَ فِى ٱلْعِلْمِ مِنْهُمْ وَٱلْمُؤْمِنُونَ يُؤْمِنُونَ بِمَآ أُنزِلَ إِلَيْكَ وَمَآ أُنزِلَ مِن قَبْلِكَ ۚ وَٱلْمُقِيمِينَ ٱلصَّلَوٰةَ ۚ وَٱلْمُؤْتُونَ ٱلزَّكَوٰةَ وَٱلْمُؤْمِنُونَ بِٱللَّهِ وَٱلْيَوْمِ ٱلْـَٔاخِرِ أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ سَنُؤْتِيهِمْ أَجْرًا عَظِيمًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"But those of them who are well grounded in knowledge and have faith do believe in what has been revealed to you [Muhammad], and in what was revealed before you- those who perform the prayers, pay the prescribed alms, and believe in God and the Last Day- to them We shall give a great reward.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"لَّـٰكِنِ","en_gloss":"But","transliteration":"lākini","verse_key":"4:162"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلرَّٰسِخُونَ","en_gloss":"the ones who are firm","transliteration":"l-rāsikhūna","verse_key":"4:162"},{"pos":3,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"4:162"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلْعِلْمِ","en_gloss":"the knowledge","transliteration":"l-ʿil'mi","verse_key":"4:162"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مِنْهُمْ","en_gloss":"among them","transliteration":"min'hum","verse_key":"4:162"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَٱلْمُؤْمِنُونَ","en_gloss":"and the believers","transliteration":"wal-mu'minūna","verse_key":"4:162"},{"pos":7,"ar":"يُؤْمِنُونَ","en_g